WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:04,850
Since my leg injury, others have only noticed that my fate is not as good as mine. I am pious and regretful.

2
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:10,650
Or scold me for being bad at English. No one has ever asked me why I push myself to this point.

3
00:00:10,650 --> 00:00:15,600
Shenhuai secretly joined the prince as early as possible. The prince deceived me on the surface.

4
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:19,080
In fact, he is trying to win him over step by step, just to make me an obedient dog in his hands.

5
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:22,720
And Shen Huaijin has been secretly pushing and fighting.

6
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:27,630
If I don't take this opportunity to have my belly pierced, they will dismantle me sooner or later.

7
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:32,540
The only person I feel sorry for is my grandfather

8
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:36,530
My grandfather raised me up with great admiration all his life.

9
00:00:36,530 --> 00:00:38,690
But Shen Huaijin is his most beloved young son

10
00:00:38,690 --> 00:00:42,370
I moved step by step and all my relatives calculated that I would pay the price

11
00:00:42,370 --> 00:00:45,380
This leg is what I gave to my grandfather.
